> SDSM and a HoB, I have a blessed magic marker and Grayswandir)

If you are not going for a conduct ascension, this would be a good time
to genocide some nasty monsters (such as h). Scrolls of magic mapping
are handy in Gehennom. You should have collected a few wands of digging:
Use them to make an easy way between the stairs of the maze levels. Write
scrolls of enchant armour and x-proof and enchant your gear. Mix potions
of full healing. Don't bother too much with the junk lying around, it is
likely that you don't need most of it anyway. Don't expect your god to
help you in hell.

The main point now is to explore the mazes, mark the invocation point,
create an easy escape route for the final trip with the amulet and grab
the CoI. Then, you will have to prepare for the last dive.

And, of course: Keep cool, stay calm.

